w step dad a few hours later. He was a local police Capt &amp; worked night shift.","userId":960956305799131136,"media":null,"username":"CitizenDame1","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1044026812953591814","date":1537750363000,"rawContent":"It replays so vividly over &amp; over as if it were happening again. I can recall smells, sounds, every feeling and I've prayed it go away but it does, its the nightmares that haunt your dreams nightly.\n#metoo","userId":960956305799131136,"media":null,"username":"CitizenDame1","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1045354582086283264","date":1538066928000,"rawContent":"@KamalaHarris Please convey to Dr Ford I'm watching &amp; how I love her for speaking out, her courage to reveal her recollection of the attack by Kavanaugh in '82 gave me the courage to open up on my own attack in '51 that I had been to ashamed &amp; afraid to ever reveal before. Hug her for #metoo!","userId":960956305799131136,"media":null,"username":"CitizenDame1","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0}]